- $\sum_{p} t_{\text{B3},p} \cdot x_{B,\text{B3},p} \leq T_{\text{B3}}$ (only for allowed $p$)

#### Objective (expanded)
\[
\max \left\{
\sum_{p \in P} s_p y_p
- \sum_{p \in P} c_p y_p
- \sum_{e \in A} \frac{C_e}{T_e} \sum_{p \in P_e} t_{e,p} x_{A,e,p}
- \sum_{e \in B} \frac{C_e}{T_e} \sum_{p \in P_e} t_{e,p} x_{B,e,p}
\right\}
\]

